## Why This Is Asked

This question evaluates your ability to design effective onboarding programs that balance learning with immediate contribution, demonstrating leadership in growing technical organizations.

## Key Concepts

- Structured mentorship programs
- Progressive responsibility scaling
- End-to-end feature delivery
- CI/CD pipeline ownership
- Incident response procedures
- Onboarding effectiveness metrics

## Code Example

```javascript
// Onboarding Progress Tracker
const onboardingPlan = {
  week1: ['codebase immersion', 'starter bug fixes'],
  week2: ['feature development', 'code review participation'],
  week3: ['CI/CD ownership', 'runbook maintenance'],
  week4: ['incident response', 'postmortem analysis']
};

const milestones = {
  milestone1: 'Complete first code review and merge',
  milestone2: 'Deliver end-to-end feature independently',
  milestone3: 'Lead incident response simulation'
};

const rituals = {
  daily: 'Standup with senior buddy',
  weekly: 'Progress review with engineering manager',
  biweekly: 'Knowledge sharing session'
};

const metrics = {
  timeToFirstMerge: 'Days from onboarding to first merged PR',
  incidentResponseParticipation: 'Active involvement in incident drills'
};
```

